WEBVTT

00:26.450 --> 00:26.900
[Name: Du Cong]

00:38.920 --> 00:40.320
Look at these big fruits.

00:40.520 --> 00:41.050
How nice.

00:41.520 --> 00:42.430
I told you so, didn't I?

00:42.430 --> 00:43.240
They're all nice fruits.

00:43.240 --> 00:43.710
Yes.

00:44.390 --> 00:45.880
You'll be in charge of grocery shopping
from now on.

00:45.880 --> 00:47.070
I'd rather stay out of it.

00:47.070 --> 00:47.800
Absolutely.

00:48.240 --> 00:48.710
Dad,

00:49.840 --> 00:50.430
Mom,

00:52.070 --> 00:53.470
I'm such an unfilial son.

00:54.200 --> 00:55.600
This parting could be...

01:01.760 --> 01:04.879
♪ The stars twinkle, the moon curves ♪

01:08.870 --> 01:13.570
♪ A gentle breeze
sways the willow branches ♪

01:14.150 --> 01:15.550
It's the two of you again.

01:16.030 --> 01:19.289
♪ The two of us, working late at night,
sneak up to the base of the wall ♪

01:18.000 --> 01:20.480
The same bad thing
could happen once or twice,

01:20.480 --> 01:22.680
but not three or four times!

01:22.789 --> 01:23.520
[Do not trample on the plants]

01:22.920 --> 01:26.030
♪ Sneaking around, peeking through ♪

01:33.680 --> 01:36.590
"Never cave in to reality."

02:00.950 --> 02:02.680
Never cave in to reality.

02:03.640 --> 02:05.400
Never cave in to reality.

02:05.760 --> 02:07.590
Never cave in to reality.

02:15.870 --> 02:19.390
Never cave in to reality.

03:44.630 --> 03:48.440
[Born with Luck]

03:48.470 --> 03:51.380
[Episode 19]

03:54.880 --> 03:57.490
[Forensic Lab of Sanjiangkou
Municipal Public Security Bureau]

03:57.190 --> 03:58.870
The substance found at the scene
last night

03:57.510 --> 03:58.620
[Physical Evidence Examination Report]

04:00.120 --> 04:00.980
is human blood.

04:09.960 --> 04:10.680
Judging from

04:10.680 --> 04:11.870
what we know of now,

04:12.190 --> 04:12.830
the dead

04:13.400 --> 04:14.660
is most likely Liu Bei.

04:15.470 --> 04:16.870
So, now, our primary goal

04:17.720 --> 04:18.480
is to find

04:18.829 --> 04:21.089
Liu Bei and the killer.

04:21.560 --> 04:23.560
Alive or dead, there has to be proof.

04:23.950 --> 04:24.750
That is to say,

04:24.950 --> 04:26.390
all the vehicles and people

04:26.390 --> 04:27.870
passing by the intersection

04:27.870 --> 04:29.270
near Xiangji Temple must be

04:29.270 --> 04:30.000
looked into.

04:31.000 --> 04:32.360
It is the evening rush hour.

04:32.360 --> 04:34.000
The traffic conditions
at the intersection are complex,

04:34.000 --> 04:35.390
with a large flow of people.

04:35.390 --> 04:36.120
Chief Zhang,

04:36.430 --> 04:37.690
we need more manpower.

04:39.560 --> 04:40.040
Li Qian,

04:40.750 --> 04:41.680
give them a hand.

04:48.350 --> 04:49.240
It's temporary.

04:49.240 --> 04:50.020
You'll only spent

04:50.020 --> 04:51.360
a couple of days with them.

04:51.360 --> 04:52.600
Just obey the order.

04:53.280 --> 04:54.330
You are a girl.

04:54.390 --> 04:56.190
Chief Zhang had no other choice.

05:01.870 --> 05:03.530
He just caved under pressure.

05:09.270 --> 05:10.190
Where was I?

05:10.310 --> 05:11.390
We need to find Liu Bei and the killer.

05:11.390 --> 05:12.390
Liu Bei and the killer. Right.

05:12.390 --> 05:13.670
We propose to merge

05:13.750 --> 05:14.620
this case

05:14.920 --> 05:16.630
with Zhou Rong's case.

05:17.800 --> 05:18.800
What do you think?

05:19.240 --> 05:20.500
Human blood was found,

05:20.510 --> 05:21.190
but how do we prove

05:21.190 --> 05:22.050
it's Liu Bei's?

05:22.310 --> 05:23.430
Even if it is Liu Bei's,

05:23.430 --> 05:25.030
how do we prove he was killed?

05:32.430 --> 05:33.940
The surveillance footage

05:34.000 --> 05:34.920
shows that Liu Bei

05:34.920 --> 05:36.720
came in carrying a suitcase.

05:37.190 --> 05:38.790
So these are his footprints.

05:40.480 --> 05:42.409
But the man who left was not Liu Bei.

05:43.240 --> 05:45.159
This is a mark left by the suitcase wheels

05:45.159 --> 05:46.690
when this man went away.

05:46.720 --> 05:47.950
Pay attention to this trail.

05:47.950 --> 05:48.720
It's deeper.

05:50.270 --> 05:52.000
There is only one possibility.

05:52.000 --> 05:52.630
That is, the dead

05:52.630 --> 05:53.760
was in the suitcase.

05:53.800 --> 05:54.730
And this dead man

05:54.920 --> 05:55.580
was Liu Bei.

05:56.480 --> 05:57.190
But there are barely

05:57.190 --> 05:59.190
any signs of a struggle at the scene.

05:59.390 --> 06:01.120
The killer took his target down
with only one move.

06:01.120 --> 06:02.380
With Liu Bei's skills,

06:02.680 --> 06:03.560
who could be so capable

06:03.560 --> 06:04.960
as to kill him instantly?

06:08.270 --> 06:10.000
There must be someone as strong as that.

06:10.000 --> 06:10.560
Who?

06:14.190 --> 06:14.720
Yeah.

06:16.070 --> 06:16.600
Who?

06:18.220 --> 06:19.620
Finding out who it is

06:20.040 --> 06:21.430
is what we are going

06:21.480 --> 06:22.360
to do next.

06:22.430 --> 06:22.870
Right?

06:23.830 --> 06:25.010
Chief, please go on.

06:26.120 --> 06:27.390
We watched the surveillance footage

06:27.390 --> 06:29.320
near the crime scene this morning,

06:29.600 --> 06:31.400
and found a suspicious vehicle.

06:32.000 --> 06:33.659
This car also has a fake plate.

06:33.920 --> 06:35.000
In the past few days, this car

06:35.000 --> 06:36.240
got in two traffic accidents

06:36.240 --> 06:38.190
with cars owned by Rongcheng Group.

06:38.190 --> 06:38.650
Li Qian,

06:38.830 --> 06:39.480
when your car

06:39.480 --> 06:40.140
rear-ended

06:40.240 --> 06:41.630
that Rongcheng Group's car that day,

06:41.630 --> 06:43.600
the car that fled the scene was this one.

06:43.600 --> 06:44.860
Were all the incidents

06:44.920 --> 06:46.050
just coincidental?

06:46.950 --> 06:48.120
I don't think so.

06:49.360 --> 06:50.560
These two people were highly likely

06:50.560 --> 06:51.890
in cahoots with Liu Bei,

06:52.310 --> 06:53.270
so they also sneaked into

06:53.270 --> 06:54.330
Zhou Rong's manor.

06:55.430 --> 06:56.560
This provides an answer

06:56.560 --> 06:57.920
to Li Qian's question just now.

06:57.920 --> 06:58.450
It is true

06:58.670 --> 07:00.240
that Liu Bei was a great fighter.

07:00.240 --> 07:01.040
But what if he was

07:01.040 --> 07:02.700
caught completely off guard?

07:03.240 --> 07:05.500
What if he was killed by an acquaintance?

07:07.480 --> 07:08.410
This is my guess:

07:09.820 --> 07:11.080
it was these two people

07:12.070 --> 07:13.200
who robbed Zhou Rong

07:14.000 --> 07:15.260
and beat up Lang Bowen.

07:16.190 --> 07:17.630
Suppose they were indeed

07:17.650 --> 07:18.850
working with Liu Bei,

07:18.920 --> 07:20.970
then that phone and the suitcase

07:21.240 --> 07:22.700
must be in their hands now.

07:24.080 --> 07:25.330
I suggest we treat these two people

07:25.330 --> 07:27.100
as our primary targets now.

07:27.130 --> 07:27.900
I agree.

07:28.510 --> 07:29.040
I agree.

07:29.060 --> 07:29.720
-Agreed.
-Agreed.

07:29.720 --> 07:30.240
I agree.

07:30.310 --> 07:31.370
-Agreed.
-I agree.

07:32.590 --> 07:34.120
If you all concur with me...

07:34.159 --> 07:35.020
I beg to differ.

07:37.000 --> 07:37.920
Why?

07:38.430 --> 07:40.450
It doesn't seem to me that Zhou Rong

07:40.480 --> 07:42.210
was robbed by these two people.

07:42.360 --> 07:43.760
I've seen those two guys.

07:43.830 --> 07:45.800
Hadn't you been knocked out by then?

07:45.800 --> 07:46.720
I woke up later and got

07:46.720 --> 07:48.120
a blurry glimpse of them.

07:48.750 --> 07:49.630
They don't look like the robbers.

07:49.630 --> 07:51.890
Didn't you say their faces were covered?

07:52.750 --> 07:55.610
That's why I said
they didn't look like the robbers.

08:02.310 --> 08:03.720
Li Qian just made

08:04.690 --> 08:06.150
a rather good point.

08:06.950 --> 08:08.270
Everyone, try to collect

08:08.270 --> 08:09.670
evidence in this regard.

08:10.240 --> 08:10.640
Got it.

08:10.800 --> 08:12.980
Before new evidence is found,

08:13.040 --> 08:13.630
these two people

08:13.630 --> 08:15.360
are still our primary targets.

08:17.680 --> 08:18.190
Agreed?

08:24.600 --> 08:25.070
Agreed.

08:27.190 --> 08:28.390
Find out who they are.

08:28.680 --> 08:29.310
I just did.

08:31.600 --> 08:32.700
The driver is Mao Hongwei,

08:32.700 --> 08:33.650
nicknamed Mao.

08:33.750 --> 08:34.240
The other man

08:34.240 --> 08:35.840
should be a fellow of his, Xia Tinggang.

08:35.840 --> 08:37.150
They operate a scrap yard

08:36.159 --> 08:41.299
[Building 2]

08:37.200 --> 08:39.200
near the chemical industrial zone.

08:59.910 --> 09:00.570
Have you...

09:01.120 --> 09:02.050
seen a dead body?

09:04.150 --> 09:06.120
N-Not when it's so close.

09:10.240 --> 09:11.600
Y-You go take a look.

09:12.910 --> 09:13.720
No, you do it.

09:17.080 --> 09:18.680
L-Let's do it together then.

09:39.600 --> 09:40.660
What are you doing?

09:42.270 --> 09:43.330
What are you doing?

09:54.440 --> 09:55.170
What is this?

09:59.550 --> 10:00.320
This is...

10:03.390 --> 10:04.450
the murder weapon.

10:05.000 --> 10:05.730
No, it's not.

10:05.840 --> 10:07.080
Didn't you see that guy's

10:07.080 --> 10:07.720
slit on the neck?

10:07.720 --> 10:09.250
It must be caused by a knife.

10:10.150 --> 10:11.410
Let me venture a guess.

10:12.600 --> 10:14.000
The killer first knocked out
the dead with this,

10:14.000 --> 10:15.320
and then slit his neck
with a knife.

10:15.320 --> 10:16.070
Otherwise, why would

10:16.070 --> 10:16.600
this thing

10:16.600 --> 10:17.980
be placed beside the body?

10:17.980 --> 10:18.840
I bet the killer meant to

10:18.840 --> 10:19.480
dump the body

10:19.480 --> 10:21.280
and throw away the weapon later.

10:23.150 --> 10:23.550
Right?

10:25.440 --> 10:26.480
Quite smug, aren't you?

10:26.480 --> 10:27.540
Dump the body, huh?

10:28.000 --> 10:29.060
Dump the body, huh?

10:30.200 --> 10:31.120
I sent you out to snatch money.

10:31.120 --> 10:31.960
Why did you bring back

10:31.960 --> 10:32.550
a dead body instead?

10:32.550 --> 10:32.960
W-Who

10:33.080 --> 10:34.750
would've known this could happen?

10:34.750 --> 10:35.750
That man looks...

10:35.960 --> 10:37.200
just like Sakuragi Hanamichi.

10:37.200 --> 10:38.930
Who would know he is a murderer?

10:39.000 --> 10:40.080
How was I supposed to know

10:40.080 --> 10:41.630
there was a body in this suitcase?

10:41.630 --> 10:42.550
Would I have known that?

10:42.550 --> 10:43.390
You didn't expect it, did you?

10:43.390 --> 10:44.750
I didn't expect any of this.

10:44.750 --> 10:45.150
Didn't expect this?

10:45.150 --> 10:45.790
Why were you so careless?

10:45.790 --> 10:46.720
How could you be this ignorant?

10:46.720 --> 10:48.390
What's this for?

10:49.240 --> 10:50.640
Now see what you've started.

10:50.640 --> 10:52.000
Instead of money, you brought

10:52.000 --> 10:53.400
such grave trouble back.

10:56.480 --> 10:57.720
Let's call the police then.

10:57.720 --> 10:59.470
K-K-Keep your voice down.

10:57.820 --> 11:00.900
[Taxi]

11:01.790 --> 11:02.990
Call the police, huh?

11:04.360 --> 11:04.890
It's true

11:05.270 --> 11:06.870
that we didn't kill this man.

11:08.200 --> 11:09.410
But for driving this fake taxi

11:09.410 --> 11:10.290
for robbery,

11:10.360 --> 11:12.080
we'll still be put in prison, won't we?

11:12.080 --> 11:12.960
Which will keep you

11:12.960 --> 11:14.200
behind bars longer,

11:14.270 --> 11:15.120
driving a fake taxi

11:15.120 --> 11:16.700
for robbery, or killing a man?

11:16.640 --> 11:22.320
[Taxi]

11:17.390 --> 11:19.250
No, we didn't kill this man.

11:20.150 --> 11:21.320
And I didn't borrow that money.

11:21.320 --> 11:23.250
Why should I be put in jail with you?

11:24.320 --> 11:25.390
Driving a fake taxi

11:25.670 --> 11:26.320
for robbery

11:26.320 --> 11:27.030
was your idea.

11:27.030 --> 11:28.790
-I told you to keep it down!
-I can prove that!

11:28.790 --> 11:30.250
I should have a say in this!

11:31.670 --> 11:33.130
C-Come over here and talk.

11:34.000 --> 11:34.870
I won't hit you.

11:35.440 --> 11:37.370
Come and talk to me in a lower voice.

11:38.480 --> 11:39.480
What if you hit me?

11:39.840 --> 11:40.120
I...

11:41.100 --> 11:41.760
If I hit you,

11:41.790 --> 11:42.960
I'll die without descendants.

11:42.960 --> 11:43.490
Alright?

11:53.840 --> 11:54.440
Tinggang,

11:55.320 --> 11:57.050
let's throw the suitcase away.

11:57.840 --> 11:58.320
Where?

12:00.720 --> 12:01.890
Anywhere is fine.

12:02.120 --> 12:03.450
The farther the better.

12:24.790 --> 12:26.510
Never cave in to reality.

12:42.670 --> 12:44.120
They've been disturbing

12:44.150 --> 12:45.200
all the neighbors.

12:45.200 --> 12:46.440
They should've been caught long ago.

12:46.440 --> 12:47.600
They should've been dealt with long ago.

12:47.600 --> 12:49.600
See, you guys waited so long to do so.

12:56.440 --> 12:57.630
Where have they gone?

12:57.630 --> 12:58.260
Chief,

12:58.440 --> 12:59.240
Captain Wang,

12:59.360 --> 13:00.290
those two guys were seen

13:00.290 --> 13:02.220
driving a car away half an hour ago.

13:03.840 --> 13:05.190
Hand out photos of them.

13:05.390 --> 13:06.750
Notify all checkpoints.

13:06.750 --> 13:08.320
Don't let them leave Sanjiangkou.

13:08.320 --> 13:08.720
Got it.

13:10.870 --> 13:11.300
Listen,

13:11.300 --> 13:12.100
Team 1, Team 2,

13:12.150 --> 13:12.750
follow me!

13:36.670 --> 13:37.340
My little grandson

13:37.340 --> 13:39.390
took one yuan with him
and went to buy a popsicle.

13:39.390 --> 13:40.600
But those two men robbed him

13:40.600 --> 13:41.910
just as he reached that alley entrance.

13:41.910 --> 13:43.370
He's just a six-year-old.

13:43.390 --> 13:44.120
See,

13:44.630 --> 13:45.670
in this neighborhood,

13:45.670 --> 13:46.670
all women—

13:47.320 --> 13:48.520
each and every woman—

13:48.670 --> 13:49.790
would never hang

13:50.120 --> 13:51.480
their washed underware outside.

13:51.480 --> 13:51.960
That's right.

13:51.960 --> 13:52.960
Or it'd be stolen.

13:53.270 --> 13:55.130
What kind of person would do that?

13:56.730 --> 13:57.610
Thank you all.

13:58.000 --> 13:59.260
The clues you provided

13:59.320 --> 14:01.320
are helpful for our investigation.

14:01.390 --> 14:02.520
Just hurry and arrest

14:02.520 --> 14:03.360
those two scumbags.

14:03.360 --> 14:04.000
Yes, arrest them.

14:04.000 --> 14:04.960
We will. Rest assured.

14:04.960 --> 14:05.430
Thank you.

14:05.430 --> 14:06.030
Thank you.

14:06.080 --> 14:06.880
Thank you too.

14:07.120 --> 14:07.850
Thanks a lot.

14:08.030 --> 14:09.630
They'll be caught sooner or later.

14:09.630 --> 14:10.750
They're never up to any good, are they?

14:10.750 --> 14:11.200
Exactly.

14:11.200 --> 14:12.530
Such peace destroyers.

14:20.360 --> 14:22.020
Are they really the culprits?

14:42.330 --> 14:43.820
[Name: Hu Qinghua]

14:42.550 --> 14:44.150
Money solves every problem.

14:46.360 --> 14:47.820
One million US dollars...

14:48.080 --> 14:50.010
It's equal to over 60 million yuan.

14:50.150 --> 14:52.610
We can each take more than 30 million.

14:55.790 --> 14:56.720
With your math skills,

14:56.720 --> 14:58.850
it's a shame you're not an accountant.

14:59.510 --> 15:00.480
One million US dollars

15:00.480 --> 15:02.210
is equal to over 7 million yuan.

15:06.000 --> 15:07.480
Only 7 million yuan?

15:07.790 --> 15:08.750
"Only"?

15:09.600 --> 15:10.750
How much is that God of Wealth statue

15:10.750 --> 15:11.510
you moved?

15:11.840 --> 15:12.510
In your entire life,

15:12.510 --> 15:14.120
have you ever seen 7 million?

15:15.240 --> 15:15.630
I...

15:16.480 --> 15:17.700
Splitting 7 million

15:17.910 --> 15:19.240
between the two of us...

15:19.550 --> 15:21.750
We'll each have only a little
more than 3 million.

15:21.750 --> 15:23.750
That's not even enough to get a wife.

15:25.150 --> 15:26.880
It costs that much to get a wife?

15:27.000 --> 15:29.200
Then this woman can't be your true love.

15:29.320 --> 15:30.520
You made a good point.

15:31.480 --> 15:32.080
Listen,

15:32.720 --> 15:33.840
do you think true love exists

15:33.840 --> 15:34.750
in this world?

15:37.910 --> 15:39.240
When I'm about to dress as a woman,

15:39.240 --> 15:39.870
don't ask me

15:39.870 --> 15:41.530
any questions about romance.

15:42.000 --> 15:42.960
Okay, got it.

15:44.720 --> 15:45.150
Hey,

15:45.600 --> 15:47.630
I'd like to go for
a different makeup style this time

15:47.630 --> 15:48.690
as a breakthrough.

15:50.440 --> 15:51.640
A breakthrough, huh?

15:52.510 --> 15:53.110
I'll help.

15:55.150 --> 15:55.810
Take a look

15:55.840 --> 15:57.840
at these two men. Have you seen them?

15:58.150 --> 15:59.000
Well...

15:59.840 --> 16:00.910
No, never.

16:01.840 --> 16:03.240
Did you look carefully?

16:03.240 --> 16:04.300
Take a closer look.

16:12.910 --> 16:14.970
Sir, careful. The floor is slippery.

16:27.630 --> 16:29.200
I really haven't seen them.

16:30.630 --> 16:31.790
Show me the registration record

16:31.790 --> 16:32.630
of guests then.

16:32.630 --> 16:33.510
Well, I...

16:33.600 --> 16:34.960
What? Hurry!

16:38.090 --> 16:38.950
Sorry for that.

16:52.670 --> 16:53.880
There isn't even a photo.

16:53.880 --> 16:55.610
How do I understand any of this?

16:57.120 --> 16:57.510
Gosh. Look.

16:57.510 --> 16:58.480
Such messy handwriting.

16:58.480 --> 16:59.510
H-How can I read this?

16:59.510 --> 17:01.110
Do you know what it says here?

17:13.589 --> 17:15.109
You're disguising as a blind man now.

17:15.109 --> 17:17.000
Acting like this will blow your cover.

17:17.000 --> 17:17.730
Give it to me.

17:23.960 --> 17:24.510
Watch me.

17:29.110 --> 17:29.910
You have a try.

17:34.790 --> 17:35.650
Is it passable?

17:40.830 --> 17:42.090
Come on, give me a hand.

17:42.550 --> 17:43.550
I'm blind now.

17:55.030 --> 17:56.640
Those two bastards.

17:58.510 --> 18:00.030
Where have they gone?

18:28.200 --> 18:30.400
I just sighed. Did it affect you or what?

18:30.720 --> 18:31.310
No.

18:31.350 --> 18:32.520
The car is out of gas.

18:33.270 --> 18:34.270
Then go get some gas.

18:34.270 --> 18:35.470
Why did you pull over?

18:35.680 --> 18:37.210
It's completely out of gas.

18:39.680 --> 18:40.400
Did you step on

18:40.400 --> 18:41.400
the gas pedal too hard?

18:41.400 --> 18:42.750
This car is even older than me.

18:42.750 --> 18:43.950
I wish I could do that.

18:53.110 --> 18:53.840
What do we do?

18:57.510 --> 18:58.970
We'll have to push the car.

18:59.240 --> 19:01.100
I pulled over at the perfect spot.

19:01.200 --> 19:02.200
The sign here says

19:02.210 --> 19:03.350
there is a gas station

19:03.350 --> 19:04.680
800 meters to the right.

19:08.400 --> 19:09.930
Get out and push the car now.

19:10.830 --> 19:12.440
I guess it's the only option.

19:15.920 --> 19:16.590
Join me.

19:17.110 --> 19:18.310
But I have to stay in the car

19:18.310 --> 19:19.840
to spin the steering wheel.

19:20.030 --> 19:21.400
You can do it and push the car
at the same time.

19:21.400 --> 19:22.320
Just keep that door open.

19:22.320 --> 19:22.640
No.

19:22.660 --> 19:24.200
-You can't drive.
-Then use this arm to...

19:24.200 --> 19:24.590
I...

19:25.070 --> 19:26.070
So you don't know.

19:26.920 --> 19:28.650
For safety reasons, both hands

19:29.030 --> 19:29.760
must be on it.

19:33.440 --> 19:34.440
You really are...

19:35.080 --> 19:36.290
Fine then.

19:37.010 --> 19:42.000
[Gas Station is 800 meters away
on the right]

19:39.750 --> 19:40.210
Come on.

19:42.540 --> 19:43.230
Push!

19:47.810 --> 19:48.450
Push.

19:50.750 --> 19:51.510
Quick.

19:55.440 --> 19:57.440
F-Forgot to release the handbrake.

20:06.490 --> 20:10.380
[Diesel Oil]

20:19.680 --> 20:20.160
Ma'am,

20:20.350 --> 20:21.760
500 yuan, pump No. 3.

20:21.920 --> 20:22.980
Please pay inside.

20:23.110 --> 20:24.510
Thank you, young man.

20:28.440 --> 20:29.300
How much in gas?

20:29.350 --> 20:30.350
Two hundred yuan.

20:37.200 --> 20:38.460
Are we out of RMB notes?

20:38.640 --> 20:39.030
See,

20:39.440 --> 20:40.240
I'm blind now.

20:55.750 --> 20:57.250
I can't stand on my feet now.

20:57.250 --> 20:58.530
What is it with you?

20:58.750 --> 20:59.400
What now?

20:59.680 --> 21:01.340
Take out your money, alright?

21:01.400 --> 21:02.920
Wait. You don't have money?

21:02.920 --> 21:03.350
No, I don't.

21:03.350 --> 21:04.610
I only have 2 yuan left.

21:05.440 --> 21:06.770
Only 2 yuan in my pocket.

21:10.350 --> 21:10.790
Hurry.

21:17.350 --> 21:18.150
What's wrong?

21:18.590 --> 21:20.120
They don't take US dollars.

21:20.490 --> 21:22.060
Are they crazy,

21:22.110 --> 21:23.690
for rejecting US dollars?

21:24.590 --> 21:25.720
Where are you going?

21:28.640 --> 21:29.240
Come back!

21:33.920 --> 21:34.890
What are you going to do?

21:34.890 --> 21:36.110
Hey, ma'am, I have a question.

21:36.110 --> 21:38.590
-Why don't you take US dollars?
-Alright, stop it.

21:38.590 --> 21:39.500
My husband is grumpy.

21:39.500 --> 21:40.680
-Sorry.
-We don't take US dollars.

21:40.680 --> 21:41.910
Why not?

21:42.350 --> 21:43.750
Give me what you earned by selling junk

21:43.750 --> 21:44.410
yesterday.

21:45.110 --> 21:46.110
This is all I have.

21:47.310 --> 21:48.980
What? But I asked for
200-yuan worth of gas.

21:48.980 --> 21:50.330
Why that much?

21:51.110 --> 21:52.310
Gas is expensive now.

22:00.030 --> 22:00.760
The key's in.

22:07.790 --> 22:08.750
-What kind of attitude is this?
-Let's just go.

22:08.750 --> 22:09.800
This is China.

22:09.880 --> 22:10.440
We don't take US dollars.

22:10.440 --> 22:10.880
What's the point

22:10.880 --> 22:11.680
of saying all that?

22:11.680 --> 22:12.350
Where is your manager?

22:12.350 --> 22:13.270
I demand to see your manager.

22:13.270 --> 22:14.270
The car! Our car!

22:14.480 --> 22:15.620
This isn't over.

22:16.590 --> 22:17.590
You haven't paid!

22:21.960 --> 22:23.690
Get out of my car, you bastards!

22:24.160 --> 22:24.890
What do we do?

22:29.920 --> 22:30.850
Get in this taxi!

22:31.760 --> 22:33.770
♪ The sun is setting ♪

22:40.680 --> 22:41.510
Sir, 200 yuan.

22:42.740 --> 22:43.460
Pay up!

22:43.480 --> 22:44.720
You haven't paid up!

22:48.500 --> 22:49.790
What a nice car.

22:49.820 --> 22:51.010
So luxurious.

22:51.550 --> 22:52.710
Leather interiors.

22:54.240 --> 22:55.440
Look at this sunroof.

22:56.550 --> 22:57.430
How very nice.

22:58.520 --> 23:00.380
-That scared me.
-That scared me.

23:02.660 --> 23:03.460
Darn it!

23:04.390 --> 23:04.910
Darn it!

23:05.670 --> 23:06.760
Eyes on the road!

23:08.850 --> 23:09.360
No.

23:09.790 --> 23:10.450
How is it...

23:11.030 --> 23:11.720
back to us?

23:12.440 --> 23:13.240
P-Please stop

23:13.240 --> 23:14.070
saying that.

23:14.070 --> 23:14.880
Are we...

23:14.880 --> 23:16.140
being haunted or what?

23:19.880 --> 23:21.490
Bro, drive faster.

23:22.000 --> 23:23.640
Faster, please.

23:24.000 --> 23:25.730
I can't see those guys anymore.

23:26.640 --> 23:27.900
This is the car we abandoned.

23:27.900 --> 23:29.300
This is as fast as it gets.

23:30.920 --> 23:31.310
Bro,

23:31.960 --> 23:32.750
there is a suitcase.

23:32.750 --> 23:34.280
It looks identical to ours.

23:46.240 --> 23:46.750
Bro,

23:47.480 --> 23:49.610
the content is completely different.

23:50.300 --> 23:52.030
Tell me something I don't know.

23:52.880 --> 23:53.880
What should we do?

23:55.350 --> 23:57.080
Find those two bastards first.

23:59.750 --> 24:01.000
Zip the suitcase!

24:16.200 --> 24:17.000
You go open it.

24:17.640 --> 24:18.700
See what's inside.

24:21.270 --> 24:22.000
No, I refuse.

24:22.110 --> 24:22.770
You go do it.

24:23.000 --> 24:24.460
I already did it last time.

24:26.550 --> 24:27.000
You...

24:27.030 --> 24:27.880
Just go do it!

24:29.540 --> 24:30.300
Go!

25:11.690 --> 25:12.870
Gosh.

25:13.200 --> 25:14.160
What? What is it?

25:14.880 --> 25:15.940
Another dead body?

25:20.480 --> 25:21.410
A real surprise.

25:21.870 --> 25:22.720
Gosh.

25:22.750 --> 25:23.400
Take a look.

25:23.400 --> 25:23.960
No way.

25:23.960 --> 25:24.620
You have to!

25:25.880 --> 25:26.390
Look!

25:35.390 --> 25:38.040
♪ Bunny, bunny, bunny, bunny,
bunny, bunny ♪

25:37.640 --> 25:39.030
We're rich now, bro!

25:38.830 --> 25:40.220
♪ Love you, love you, love you ♪

25:39.110 --> 25:40.710
These are US dollars, right?

25:41.650 --> 25:44.100
♪ Bunny, bunny, bunny, bunny,
bunny, bunny ♪

25:42.720 --> 25:43.450
We have to go.

25:44.550 --> 25:45.070
Why?

25:44.970 --> 25:46.450
♪ Love you, love you, love you ♪

25:45.090 --> 25:46.000
This car is too conspicuous.

25:46.000 --> 25:47.130
We can't drive this.

25:47.790 --> 25:48.990
Then how do we go home?

25:52.590 --> 25:53.110
By bus.

25:56.820 --> 25:57.300
Okay.

25:57.590 --> 25:58.120
Let's go.

26:00.520 --> 26:03.040
♪ Get your head in the game,
we're all smart people here ♪

26:03.640 --> 26:06.420
♪ Don't drag your feet,
even gold slips through slow hands ♪

26:07.130 --> 26:08.740
♪ I beat it, I beat it ♪

26:09.540 --> 26:11.460
♪ Aye aye aye aye yo ♪

26:15.420 --> 26:17.980
♪ Bunny, bunny, bunny, bunny,
bunny, bunny ♪

26:16.280 --> 26:18.950
[No parking on the pavement;
violators will be fined 500 yuan]

26:18.930 --> 26:20.250
♪ Love you, love you, love you ♪

26:19.510 --> 26:19.990
Get out of the car.

26:19.990 --> 26:20.790
What's wrong?

26:21.550 --> 26:24.150
♪ Bunny, bunny, bunny, bunny,
bunny, bunny ♪

26:22.000 --> 26:23.330
You want to be arrested?

26:25.100 --> 26:26.580
♪ Love you, love you, love you ♪

26:27.490 --> 26:29.790
[No parking on the pavement;
violators will be fined 500 yuan]

26:30.820 --> 26:35.200
[Pull up here for a check]

26:38.970 --> 26:45.920
[Temporary checkpoint
for major quarantine forest pests]

26:45.480 --> 26:46.210
Chief Zhang.

26:46.450 --> 26:47.430
How is it going?

26:48.030 --> 26:49.030
No finding so far.

26:55.310 --> 26:56.970
Let's go to the next spot then.

26:57.000 --> 26:57.440
Okay.

26:57.830 --> 26:58.510
Keep a close eye.

26:58.510 --> 26:58.910
Got it.

27:00.720 --> 27:01.320
Good work.

27:01.440 --> 27:02.970
Understood, Captain Wang.

27:06.950 --> 27:10.300
[Temporary checkpoint
for major quarantine forest pests]

27:11.290 --> 27:12.610
Xing, pull over.

27:14.680 --> 27:15.280
What's up?

27:20.680 --> 27:22.210
Xing, go check out that car.

28:07.590 --> 28:08.270
Uncle!

28:09.590 --> 28:10.160
Uncle!

28:11.510 --> 28:13.240
When will we go fight Zhou Rong?

28:14.240 --> 28:15.440
Now.

28:17.120 --> 28:19.050
Everyone, come down and follow me!

28:22.880 --> 28:23.810
What's this for?

28:25.400 --> 28:26.730
For fighting Zhou Rong.

28:28.110 --> 28:29.540
To fight Zhou Rong,

28:30.350 --> 28:31.750
we'll use this.

28:32.110 --> 28:32.790
This?

28:35.550 --> 28:38.280
Zhou Rong took away
the ninth piece of bianzhong.

28:38.880 --> 28:39.510
Don't you think

28:39.510 --> 28:40.880
he craves the remaining pieces?

28:40.880 --> 28:41.900
Of course he does.

28:42.000 --> 28:43.130
How will he get them?

28:43.200 --> 28:44.160
He definitely craves them.

28:44.160 --> 28:45.290
How will he get them?

28:52.400 --> 28:53.280
So he's waiting

28:53.350 --> 28:55.110
for a call from us?

28:55.240 --> 28:56.110
Exactly.

28:56.400 --> 28:57.490
What should we do?

28:58.160 --> 28:59.640
Give him a call!

28:59.960 --> 29:01.160
It's hard to find a buyer.

29:01.160 --> 29:03.110
It's no easy job to find a seller
either, right?

29:03.110 --> 29:04.880
We will tell him explicitly
that the deal is off.

29:04.880 --> 29:06.830
Let's see what he is going to do.

29:17.160 --> 29:18.620
He has to double the price,

29:19.440 --> 29:21.240
or we won't sell anything to him.

29:21.240 --> 29:22.070
Agreed.

30:18.110 --> 30:19.610
Mr. Fang, why a new ride?

30:19.630 --> 30:20.250
Well,

30:20.290 --> 30:21.620
just trying to keep fit.

30:22.170 --> 30:28.310
[Protect the environment,
safeguard our home.]

30:38.700 --> 30:47.120
[Chief Huang]

30:40.310 --> 30:41.680
Get ready for a study session

30:41.680 --> 30:43.480
at the Party School in a few days.

31:03.880 --> 31:04.610
Last 3 lifts.

31:04.960 --> 31:05.710
One.

31:05.920 --> 31:06.470
Mr. Zhou,

31:06.680 --> 31:07.070
I...

31:07.100 --> 31:07.810
Shuang,

31:08.200 --> 31:09.600
would you leave the room?

31:10.270 --> 31:10.800
Mr. Zhou,

31:10.910 --> 31:11.960
a call from Fang Yong.

31:11.960 --> 31:13.720
P-P-Pick it up.

31:13.910 --> 31:14.960
Hello, Mr. Fang.

31:15.790 --> 31:16.560
It's me.

31:18.350 --> 31:18.880
What?

31:19.480 --> 31:20.350
Please don't.

31:22.200 --> 31:24.200
That was just a little accident.

31:24.200 --> 31:24.640
He...

31:25.590 --> 31:27.250
Okay, I'll tell Mr. Zhou then.

31:29.890 --> 31:30.630
This is...

31:31.640 --> 31:32.070
No way.

31:34.750 --> 31:35.200
Hello.

31:35.550 --> 31:36.080
Speak up.

31:37.270 --> 31:38.070
Help me...

31:40.000 --> 31:40.460
Hello?

31:41.440 --> 31:42.440
You failed such a trivial task.

31:42.440 --> 31:44.640
What's the point of keeping you around?

31:45.480 --> 31:46.700
Fine. G-Go ahead then.

31:46.700 --> 31:47.710
Take your time.

31:48.000 --> 31:48.860
I'm listening.

31:50.880 --> 31:51.480
That's it.

31:57.860 --> 31:58.390
Mr. Zhou!

31:58.570 --> 31:59.190
Mr. Zhou.

32:06.150 --> 32:07.660
You almost got me killed.

32:08.640 --> 32:10.030
I was asking you
to pick up the barbell, not...

32:10.030 --> 32:10.960
Sorry, Mr. Zhou.

32:11.110 --> 32:13.770
I thought you were asking me
to pick up the phone.

32:15.200 --> 32:16.060
What happened?

32:16.590 --> 32:17.590
Fang Yong called,

32:19.070 --> 32:20.870
cancelling the bianzhong deal.

32:21.440 --> 32:21.920
Why?

32:23.200 --> 32:23.930
I don't know.

32:25.200 --> 32:25.680
Wait.

32:26.350 --> 32:27.480
Zhu Yifei just refused to sell,

32:27.480 --> 32:29.640
and he immediately said he wouldn't buy?

32:29.640 --> 32:31.040
Could it be a concidence?

32:31.510 --> 32:33.550
Besides, Li Penggai called just now,

32:33.550 --> 32:35.750
saying he couldn't find those two guys.

32:36.110 --> 32:37.040
In Sanjiangkou,

32:37.510 --> 32:39.110
is there anyone I can't find?

32:39.480 --> 32:40.010
Mr. Zhou,

32:40.160 --> 32:41.270
the happenings in recent days

32:41.270 --> 32:42.310
are so weird.

32:42.750 --> 32:43.550
Is the person after us

32:43.550 --> 32:44.720
really that powerful?

32:44.720 --> 32:45.250
I mean...

33:01.680 --> 33:03.400
When those two people are caught
and their phones checked,

33:03.400 --> 33:05.330
there's nothing we can say to help.

33:05.590 --> 33:06.120
Mr. Zhou,

33:07.240 --> 33:08.840
it's time you took medicine.

33:19.340 --> 33:20.900
I once went a week

33:20.930 --> 33:22.370
without taking this medicine,

33:22.370 --> 33:23.900
and I didn't have a relapse.

33:24.000 --> 33:25.000
Do you believe it?

33:27.440 --> 33:29.010
I've told you about it.

33:29.550 --> 33:30.920
I spent an entire week

33:31.470 --> 33:33.200
on that small island Gondwana.

33:33.200 --> 33:34.070
I didn't have to think about

33:34.070 --> 33:34.550
anything there.

33:34.550 --> 33:35.810
I did nothing but eat and sleep every day.

33:35.810 --> 33:36.880
I didn't take a single pill,

33:36.880 --> 33:38.390
and I didn't have a relapse.

33:38.390 --> 33:39.440
I swore at that time

33:39.440 --> 33:42.300
that one day I'd stop taking this medicine
for good!

33:42.310 --> 33:42.880
Jianren,

33:43.590 --> 33:44.390
it is high time

33:44.480 --> 33:45.680
for me to do so!

33:48.110 --> 33:49.170
So you're planning

33:49.270 --> 33:50.310
to go to Gondwana?

33:52.200 --> 33:53.880
What if you have relapses again?

33:53.880 --> 33:54.910
Nonsense!

33:55.400 --> 33:56.790
As I said, relapses won't happen

33:56.790 --> 33:58.240
again when I live in Gondwana!

33:58.240 --> 33:58.900
Yes, right.

33:59.070 --> 33:59.680
You'll be fine.

33:59.680 --> 34:00.310
Where am I going?

34:00.310 --> 34:01.000
Gondwana!

34:01.990 --> 34:03.000
I got it, Mr. Zhou.

34:03.160 --> 34:04.540
I'll skip town with you.

34:04.750 --> 34:06.480
I've done all the preparation.

34:07.270 --> 34:08.230
What preparation?

34:08.230 --> 34:09.230
I learned English

34:09.710 --> 34:10.710
for only one purpose:

34:10.710 --> 34:12.080
by the time I'm with you,

34:12.150 --> 34:13.800
there won't be a problem with communition!

34:13.800 --> 34:14.810
You're insane.

34:15.360 --> 34:17.620
People in Gondwana don't speak English.

34:20.440 --> 34:21.320
Seriously?

34:42.960 --> 34:43.400
Bro,

34:43.920 --> 34:44.780
I feel so itchy.

34:45.320 --> 34:46.610
Am I allergic to this?

34:46.960 --> 34:48.429
Don't worry. You're not.

34:48.550 --> 34:50.810
It's made from eco-friendly materials.

34:52.400 --> 34:53.840
We only have these two IDs now.

34:53.840 --> 34:55.100
What about the others?

34:56.480 --> 34:57.710
In my suitcase.

35:06.760 --> 35:08.320
This doesn't look like me.

35:12.400 --> 35:14.260
And this even looks less like you.

35:15.190 --> 35:16.230
What if we're identified

35:16.230 --> 35:17.760
and reported to the police?

35:19.150 --> 35:20.420
We'll have to take a gamble.

35:20.420 --> 35:23.470
[Ruihao Boutique Hotel]

35:35.480 --> 35:36.410
A standard room.

35:42.030 --> 35:42.630
You IDs?

36:40.070 --> 36:41.270
A deposit of 500 yuan.

36:46.880 --> 36:49.740
Forgot to exchange for RMB.
I'll get some tomorrow.

36:51.400 --> 36:52.530
Remember to do that.

36:53.680 --> 36:54.550
Room 209.

37:10.880 --> 37:11.880
Sorry about that.

37:15.300 --> 37:17.830
Isn't that the blind man
I bumped into before?

37:43.450 --> 37:46.440
[Sanjiangkou Public Security Bureau]t

37:59.020 --> 37:59.480
Li Qian.

38:01.110 --> 38:01.910
Captain Wang.

38:03.670 --> 38:05.000
What are you going to do?

38:05.670 --> 38:07.800
I'm going to make a report to the chief.

38:09.110 --> 38:10.030
Weren't you assigned to help

38:10.030 --> 38:10.970
investigate Liu Bei's car?

38:10.250 --> 38:10.460
[Police Visit Record]

38:10.850 --> 38:12.040
[Visit Record]

38:11.280 --> 38:12.480
Why would you work on this?

38:12.480 --> 38:14.340
I think it's of great importance.

38:14.480 --> 38:15.740
I know it's important.

38:16.920 --> 38:18.120
So is obeying orders.

38:20.790 --> 38:21.440
Get back to your work.

38:21.440 --> 38:22.320
I will hand this over to Chief Zhang.

38:21.970 --> 38:22.240
[Police Visit Record]

38:32.380 --> 38:34.090
[Scrap yard]

38:37.600 --> 38:38.330
Chief Zhang.

38:40.320 --> 38:41.630
This afternoon near Dongxian Road,

38:41.630 --> 38:42.360
we found an abandoned car

38:42.360 --> 38:43.510
again, a Land Rover.

38:43.970 --> 38:45.250
[Scene Investigation Record]

38:44.030 --> 38:44.920
The car has been examined.

38:44.920 --> 38:45.960
It's Lin Kai's car.

38:45.960 --> 38:47.030
That taxi from before

38:47.030 --> 38:49.030
was the Xiali sedan that ran over Lin Kai.

38:49.030 --> 38:50.370
These two cars were both

38:50.400 --> 38:51.600
tinted and modified.

38:51.960 --> 38:53.160
Any clues in the car?

38:53.920 --> 38:55.440
Four sets of fingerprints were found.

38:55.440 --> 38:56.550
They're being compared one by one.

38:56.550 --> 38:57.320
Four people?

39:02.320 --> 39:03.050
What is this?

39:03.110 --> 39:04.800
The stuff we found
in the trunk of the Land Rover.

39:04.800 --> 39:06.230
A big box of makeup products,

39:06.230 --> 39:07.250
plus many

39:07.280 --> 39:08.110
fake IDs.

39:11.400 --> 39:12.340
And this.

39:14.030 --> 39:15.000
Today, Li Qian visited

39:15.000 --> 39:16.160
the scrap yard

39:15.380 --> 39:17.120
[Police Visit Record]

39:16.360 --> 39:17.230
and nearby residents.

39:17.230 --> 39:17.880
According to them,

39:17.880 --> 39:19.280
Xiao Mao and Xia Tinggang

39:19.360 --> 39:20.590
are just two street loafers

39:20.590 --> 39:22.150
who can hardly count as hooligans.

39:22.150 --> 39:23.230
They couldn't have committed

39:23.230 --> 39:24.760
robbery and murder, right?

39:28.480 --> 39:29.000
Chief.

39:36.230 --> 39:36.710
Chief,

39:37.280 --> 39:38.110
I really don't think

39:38.110 --> 39:40.570
Xiao Mao and Xia Tinggang
are the murderers.

39:40.590 --> 39:42.840
The killing was likely done
by two other people.

39:42.840 --> 39:43.510
Should we expand

39:43.510 --> 39:45.310
the scope of the investigation?

39:49.280 --> 39:50.570
[That young man named Li Penggai often
comes collect scrap materials at my home]

39:49.440 --> 39:51.670
It says here that when Li Penggai

39:50.570 --> 39:51.870
[He seems honest]

39:52.030 --> 39:53.760
first arrived at Sanjiangkou,

39:54.360 --> 39:55.630
he worked for over a year

39:55.630 --> 39:57.090
with Mao and Xia Tinggang.

39:57.700 --> 39:58.880
Is it true?

39:59.480 --> 40:01.480
It's known to all the old neighbors.

40:03.110 --> 40:05.220
[Xia Tinggang]

40:03.550 --> 40:05.500
After spending only a bit over one year

40:05.500 --> 40:07.100
learning from these two men,

40:07.630 --> 40:09.320
he managed to become the most favored

40:09.320 --> 40:11.790
[Hu Jianren] [Lang Bowen] [Mei Dong]

40:09.960 --> 40:12.490
security team leader
in Zhou Rong's company.

40:14.920 --> 40:16.320
Are Mao and Xia Tinggang really

40:16.320 --> 40:17.520
just street loafers?

40:19.480 --> 40:20.710
Right now, we're looking everywhere

40:20.710 --> 40:21.840
for them in the city.

40:21.920 --> 40:22.590
It's been a whole day,

40:22.590 --> 40:23.920
yet there isn't a trace of them.

40:23.920 --> 40:25.650
Could ordinary street loafers

40:26.030 --> 40:26.840
such strong

40:26.840 --> 40:28.840
counter-reconnaissance skills?\

40:31.590 --> 40:33.190
[Xia Tinggang] [Mao Hongwei]
[Suspects of the jewelry store robbery]

40:34.710 --> 40:36.110
Such sadness in the eyes.

40:37.360 --> 40:38.620
I can't read your mind.

40:42.760 --> 40:44.420
Before new findings are made,

40:45.320 --> 40:47.250
our focus is still on Mao
and Xia Tinggang.

40:46.270 --> 40:47.400
[Xia Tinggang] [Mao Hongwei]
[Suspects of the jewelry store robbery]

40:47.550 --> 40:48.360
That said, we truly

40:48.360 --> 40:50.030
need to expand the scope of search.

40:50.030 --> 40:51.250
Don't think of them

40:51.280 --> 40:52.360
as ordinary street loafers.

40:52.360 --> 40:54.090
Check all the inns and hotels.

40:54.190 --> 40:55.400
I have a hunch that these two people

40:55.400 --> 40:56.630
are experts in disguise.

40:56.630 --> 40:57.280
Besides

40:57.280 --> 40:58.720
their photos,

40:58.880 --> 40:59.920
distribute pictures

40:59.920 --> 41:00.880
of this suitcase as well.

41:00.880 --> 41:02.190
Carry out a thorough investigation

41:02.190 --> 41:03.400
whenever two men are found carrying

41:03.400 --> 41:04.280
such a suitcase.

41:04.280 --> 41:04.680
Got it.

41:11.360 --> 41:12.160
Captain Wang.

41:13.630 --> 41:15.880
You and the Chief can't treat me
like this.

41:15.880 --> 41:17.400
I should be the one saying that.

41:17.400 --> 41:17.860
Li Qian,

41:18.230 --> 41:19.490
what's wrong with you?

41:19.840 --> 41:21.880
You do the exact opposite
of what the Chief says

41:21.880 --> 41:22.760
and you keep picking on him.

41:22.760 --> 41:23.880
What are you trying to do?

41:23.880 --> 41:24.880
I do it because you and the Chief

41:24.880 --> 41:26.110
plan to transfer me off the front lines.

41:26.110 --> 41:27.030
Who's planning to do that?

41:27.030 --> 41:28.030
You and the Chief.

41:28.400 --> 41:29.110
Did the Chief assign me

41:29.110 --> 41:30.840
to watch surveillance footage

41:30.920 --> 41:33.150
because Director Gao wants to keep me
from the danger on the front line?

41:33.150 --> 41:34.280
Don't think I'm unaware of it.

41:34.280 --> 41:35.070
Who told you that?

41:35.070 --> 41:35.710
It doesn't matter.

41:35.710 --> 41:36.440
Just tell me if it's true or not.

41:36.440 --> 41:37.440
No, it's not true.

41:37.920 --> 41:39.480
Chief Zhang only told everyone

41:39.480 --> 41:40.800
to try to keep you safe.

41:41.280 --> 41:42.440
This has nothing to do
with you being assigned

41:42.440 --> 41:43.840
to watch surveillance footage.

41:43.840 --> 41:44.300
Really?

41:44.320 --> 41:44.780
Really.

41:46.070 --> 41:47.270
See, you're actually

41:47.280 --> 41:47.940
brilliant.

41:47.960 --> 41:48.710
Why not use

41:48.710 --> 41:50.360
your brain for cases instead?

41:50.360 --> 41:51.630
When anything comes up, try looking

41:51.630 --> 41:52.630
for the cause in yourself.

41:52.630 --> 41:53.710
You think there are 4 suspects.

41:53.710 --> 41:54.400
Is there enough proof?

41:54.400 --> 41:55.640
Who are the other two? Where are they?

41:55.640 --> 41:56.230
Why did they do it?

41:56.230 --> 41:57.630
Can you explain all that?

41:59.440 --> 42:00.080
Listen,

42:00.110 --> 42:01.260
based on the current clues,

42:01.260 --> 42:03.320
Chief Zhang's deduction is correct.

42:03.750 --> 42:05.550
Don't make trouble out of nothing.

42:05.550 --> 42:06.800
Just go watch surveillance footage.

42:06.800 --> 42:07.190
Yes.
